@startuml
skinparam participantStyle rectangular
participant "Server" as Server
participant "Clients" as Clients

note over Server
  Selects the data filters
  Selects the functions to be computed
end note
Server -> Clients: Sends filter and function info

note over Clients
  Chooses to Agree or Disagree to participate
end note
Clients -> Server: Sends decision (Agree/Disagree)

note over Server
  Proceeds to next workflow with agreed clients
end note

@enduml